---
source: tests/cli_root.rs
expression: out
---
Add or update a camera

Usage: qam add [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --name <name>
          Camera name (unique)
      --config <path>
          Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --host <host>
          Camera host or IP
      --port <port>
          Camera port (default 554) [default: 554]
      --protocol <protocol>
          Protocol (rtsp or rtsps) [default: rtsp]
      --user <user>
          Camera username
      --pass <pass>
          Camera password
      --path <path>
          Explicit RTSP path (e.g., /Bfy... token from UniFi Protect)
      --rtsp-transport <rtsp-transport>
          Preferred RTSP transport for this camera (tcp|udp)
      --stream <stream>
          Default RTSP stream path (stream1 or stream2)
      --rtsp-client <rtsp-client>
          Default RTSP client (ffmpeg|gortsplib)
      --no-audio[=<no-audio>]
          Default: drop audio for this camera
      --audio-codec <audio-codec>
          Default audio codec when recording (e.g., aac)
  -h, --help
          Print help
